---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="11Tech MEDE - Structured Document Evolution Methodology">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Structured & Smart <span class="hero-gradient-text">Document</span> Evolution
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Operationalize software engineering documentation through supervised causal cycles, assisted by LLMs, with mandatory human review.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
          <a href="/en/guia-rapido" class="btn btn-accent">Get Started</a>
          <a href="/en/metodologia" class="btn btn-outline">The Methodology</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div>
        <!-- Terminal Simulator -->
        <div class="terminal">
          <div class="terminal-header">
            <span class="terminal-dot red"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot yellow"></span>
            <span class="terminal-dot green"></span>
            <span class="terminal-title">bash - mede status</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-body">
            <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> npm install -g mede-cli</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">added 76 packages in 2s</div>
            <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> mede init</div>
            <div class="terminal-line terminal-output-success">✔ Project initialized in ./.mede/</div>
            <div class="terminal-line terminal-output-success">✔ Directories and live files created successfully!</div>
            <div class="terminal-line"><span class="terminal-prompt">$</span> mede status</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">========================================</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">PROJECT STATUS (MEDE)</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">========================================</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">Status: <span class="terminal-output-warning">Active Cycle (Phase: GENERATE_MEETING)</span></div>
            <div class="terminal-line">Language: en</div>
            <div class="terminal-line">Pending actions: <span class="terminal-output-warning">Awaiting approval or refinement</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section style="padding: 5rem 0; background-color: hsl(var(--color-card));">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;">
        <h2 style="font-size: 2.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Develop Software Governed by Knowledge</h2>
        <p style="color: hsl(var(--color-text-muted)); font-size: 1.1rem;">
          The MEDE methodology ensures that live technical documentation evolves in perfect sync with your software architecture business logic.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card-grid">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Human-in-the-Loop</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Nothing is automatically written to production code or main documents. Every AI suggestion is reviewed, refined, and approved by the software engineer.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🔗</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">Causal Traceability</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Connect Meeting Minutes, Architectural Decisions (ADR), Maintenance Specifications (ESM), and Delivery Logs in traceable, auditable causal cycles.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">🤖</div>
          <h3 class="card-title">LLM Assistance</h3>
          <p class="card-text">
            Connect with providers like OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, and local Ollama to analyze your repository context and suggest rich document updates.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Call to Action Section -->
  <section style="padding: 5rem 0; background: linear-gradient(135deg, hsl(var(--color-dark-bg)) 0%, hsl(220, 60%, 15%) 100%); color: #fff; text-align: center;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 45rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Ready to elevate your engineering standard?</h2>
      <p style="opacity: 0.8; font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        Install our open-source CLI tool and start automating your project documentation traceability today.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/en/guia-rapido" class="btn btn-accent">Try it for Free</a>
        <a href="/en/metodologia" class="btn btn-outline" style="border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color: #fff;">Learn more about the Methodology</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
